---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Marcel Kevin Togap Siagian">
  <main class="min-h-screen pt-32 pb-section-gap px-grid-margin max-w-[1440px] mx-auto w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter relative">
    
    <!-- Left Sticky Column -->
    <div class="md:col-span-5 relative z-10 md:sticky md:top-32 h-auto md:h-[calc(100vh-8rem)] flex flex-col gap-stack-lg">
      <div class="w-full aspect-[4/5] bg-surface-cream-dim dark:bg-surface-card-dark border border-ink-black dark:border-ink-border-dark shadow-hard shadow-ink-black overflow-hidden relative">
        <div class="bg-cover bg-center w-full h-full filter grayscale contrast-125 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center bg-surface-cream-dim dark:bg-surface-charcoal">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-terracotta uppercase mb-2">MARCEL KEVIN TOGAP SIAGIAN</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ink-black dark:text-ink-white">NIM 123140054</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs text-ink-gray dark:text-ink-slate mt-2">Institut Teknologi Sumatera (ITERA)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-stack-sm border-t border-ink-black dark:border-ink-border-dark pt-stack-md">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-ink-black dark:text-ink-white">Marcel Kevin Togap Siagian</h1>
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-gray dark:text-ink-slate">Final Year Computer Science Student &amp; Fullstack/AI Developer</p>
        <div class="flex gap-stack-sm mt-stack-sm flex-wrap">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-1 border border-ink-border-light dark:border-ink-border-dark rounded bg-surface-card-light dark:bg-surface-charcoal text-ink-gray dark:text-ink-slate">BANDAR LAMPUNG, ID</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs px-2 py-1 border border-ink-border-light dark:border-ink-border-dark rounded bg-surface-card-light dark:bg-surface-charcoal text-ink-gray dark:text-ink-slate">SEM 7 ITERA</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Scrolling Content -->
    <div class="md:col-span-7 md:col-start-7 flex flex-col gap-section-gap relative z-10">
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-stack-lg">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight uppercase tracking-tight text-ink-black dark:text-ink-white font-bold">
          BUILDING <br/>
          <span class="italic text-primary">BACKEND &amp; AI</span> <br/>
          WITH INTENT.
        </h2>
        <div class="h-px w-full bg-ink-black dark:bg-ink-border-dark"></div>
        <div class="font-sans text-base lg:text-lg flex flex-col gap-stack-md max-w-2xl text-ink-gray dark:text-ink-slate leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Saya adalah mahasiswa semester akhir (Semester 7) Teknik Informatika di Institut Teknologi Sumatera (ITERA). Memiliki minat mendalam pada pengembangan sistem backend, arsitektur database, analisis data, serta integrasi solusi Artificial Intelligence.
          </p>
          <p>
            Selain berkuliah, saya aktif menjadi Asisten Laboratorium &amp; Asisten Tutorial di ITERA untuk 8 mata kuliah utama ilmu komputer, serta berhasil meraih penghargaan <strong>Top 10% Scholar Nasional</strong> dari 2.000+ pendaftar pada program Beasiswa AI Developer AI4IMPACT.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Technical Competencies -->
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-stack-lg">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold border-b border-ink-black dark:border-ink-border-dark pb-stack-sm text-ink-black dark:text-ink-white">
          Technical Competencies
        </h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-stack-md font-mono text-sm text-ink-black dark:text-ink-white">
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-stack-sm">
            <li>&gt; Node.js &amp; Express APIs</li>
            <li>&gt; PostgreSQL &amp; MongoDB</li>
            <li>&gt; Python Data Analysis</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-stack-sm">
            <li>&gt; C++ Programming</li>
            <li>&gt; AI Chatbot Integration</li>
            <li>&gt; Cloud Computing (Alibaba)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Key Honors & Grants -->
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-stack-lg">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold border-b border-ink-black dark:border-ink-border-dark pb-stack-sm text-ink-black dark:text-ink-white">
          Honors &amp; Grants
        </h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-stack-md">
          <!-- Award 1 -->
          <div class="p-stack-md border border-ink-black dark:border-ink-border-dark bg-surface-card-light dark:bg-surface-card-dark shadow-hard hover:shadow-hard-hover hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all">
            <div class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-terracotta mb-stack-sm">AUG 2024</div>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-ink-black dark:text-ink-white mb-stack-sm">Top 10% National AI Scholar</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-ink-gray dark:text-ink-slate">Awarded by AI4IMPACT (Terra AI) out of 2,000+ applicants in the national AI Developer track.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Award 2 -->
          <div class="p-stack-md border border-ink-black dark:border-ink-border-dark bg-surface-card-light dark:bg-surface-card-dark shadow-hard hover:shadow-hard-hover hover:-translate-y-1 hover:-translate-x-1 transition-all">
            <div class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-sage mb-stack-sm">2024 — 2026</div>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-ink-black dark:text-ink-white mb-stack-sm">Alibaba Cloud Certified Developer</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-ink-gray dark:text-ink-slate">Official certification for cloud architecture and server deployment.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
